Package: hunmin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, fcitx5
Description: Korean input method engine (libhunmin core + fcitx5 addon)
 libhunmin is a portable Hangul input engine where keyboard layouts are
 data files rather than code. It matches libhangul behaviour for the
 standard layouts (golden-vector and parity tests) and implements
 신세벌식 P2 (sin3-p2) including symbol tiers, 초성체 and 옛한글 rules.
 .
 This package ships the shared library, the hunmin-sim trace simulator,
 the layout/compose data files, and the fcitx5 addon (addon and input
 method name "hunmin", coexisting with fcitx5-hangul).
